post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'

  Streamer is installed to /opt/streamer (read-only) and on your PATH as
  `streamer` (CLI) and `streamer-gui` (Vulkan/Wayland GUI).

  Before first use, edit ~/.config/streamer/config.toml and fill in
  app_id/app_secret under [[accounts]] by hand, then run `streamer login`.
  The file is created the first time streamer runs if it doesn't exist yet.

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
    :
}
